        "body": "CrowdStrike is a publicly traded global cybersecurity company (Nasdaq: CRWD, CIK 0001535527) that describes itself as a leader in stopping breaches through an AI-native approach. Its core offering is the Falcon Platform, a cloud-native system designed to protect endpoints, cloud workloads, identities, and data. The company describes the platform as covering three fronts in what it calls the AI era: defending against AI-powered vulnerability exploitation, securing cloud environments through combined agent and agentless protection, and providing AI-specific security features including AI model scanning and an AI security dashboard.\n\nCrowdStrike's tracked AI product is Charlotte AI, positioned within the security and identity AI category. The company describes it as serving security operations functions including threat detection, autonomous response, and high-privilege access management. No litigation, MCP server registrations, SEC filings beyond the basic registration, or patent records are held for CrowdStrike at this time.",
